  "description": "Core SVG parsing and rendering for ZXUI.Svg. Pure .NET library — only dependency is SkiaSharp. Loads SVG files (path / polyline / polygon / line / circle / ellipse / rect + viewBox), exposes SkiaSharp SKPicture / SKPath, and renders to PNG bytes / files / SKCanvas. Use directly in console / server / Unity apps, or pair with a UI binding (ZXUI.Svg.Avalonia for Avalonia). Target framework: net10.0.",
  "id": "ZXUI.Svg.Core",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-09T09:36:10.86Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "Ihe3yxchiMn9/mAMK5d7z98jl53UYEA6UANIk9K1n45f1VTuLrUv63lM2+Xn0kReXuC9u8ZmFEdgWh7ZXuhTPA==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 31921,
  "published": "2026-10-09T09:33:17.25Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.4 ——\n- 新增 <circle> / <ellipse> / <rect> 解析支持（依赖 SKPath.AddCircle / AddOval / AddRect / AddRoundRect）。\n  此前这三类元素被静默忽略，导致以 <circle> 为主体的图标（feather info-circle / warning-circle / x-circle 等）丢失圆环、只显示内部符号。\n- <rect> 支持 rx/ry 圆角：两个属性只写一个时互相继承；超过 width/2 或 height/2 时自动钳到一半；负值视作 0。\n\n1.0.2 ——\n- 包内附带 README.md（修复 nuget.org 上的 \"Readme missing\" 警告，README 路径指向仓库根目录）。\n\n1.0.1 ——\n- 新增 <path d=\"...\"> 解析支持：path mini-language（M / L / H / V / C / S / Q / T / A / Z）交给 SkiaSharp 原生 SKPath.ParseSvgPathData 解析。\n  此前只解析 polyline / polygon / line，导致以 <path> 为主体的图标（feather-save、feather-download 等）只画出局部线条、主体缺失。\n\n首发版 —— 纯 .NET SVG 核心库（ZXUI.Svg 拆分出来的底层）。\n\n提供：\n- SvgDocument：SVG 文档（viewBox + SkiaSharp SKPicture）\n- 加载：Load(path) / Load(stream) / Load(XDocument)\n- 渲染：RenderToPngBytes(w, h, background?) / SavePng(path, w, h) / DrawToCanvas(canvas, w, h, paint?)\n- 输出 SkiaSharp 原生类型：SKPicture / SKPath / SKColor\n\n支持 SVG 子集：path / polyline / polygon / line / circle / ellipse / rect + viewBox。\n\n零 UI 框架依赖 —— 只依赖 SkiaSharp。Console / 服务器 / Unity 等任意 .NET 项目都能用。",
